== battled_hecate ==
Hecate: ...
Liora: I... won?
Hecate: You won fair and square. You were ready all along and I just never realized.
Hecate: Here, I made a potion that should help you on your quest.
Liora: Thank you, Mom!!
Hecate: Also, here is the gem you were looking for. It dropped right at my feet as I was collecting herbs.
Liora: Yay! Now I just have to put it in the gate. Thanks again Mom! I'll see you later.
Hecate: ...
Hecuba: Shouldn't you have told her?
Hecate: "Being a Royal Guardsman and The Court Magician was no easy task". Even if I had told her that, it would have been no different. You can see her passion and drive clear as day.
Hecuba: Still, maybe a little explanation would be best.
Hecate: Maybe in the future when she achieves her goals. Then I will tell her all about my past. And about the potential she holds.
Hecuba: Very well, master.
-> END